                    {
                        "recipe_order": 7,
                        "step": "Heat the medium to boiling while bubbling with a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture. After boiling, cool the medium in a water bath. Continue bubbling with the same gas mixture. While the medium is still warm, add the following: "
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "After the medium is cooled to room temperature, adjust pH to 6.0 - 6.1. Dispense the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml in Balch type tubes) under the same gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
                    }
                ],
